ble marks violate an explicit cutting-aware product contract. Renaming them engraving is not repair. Keep manufacturing intent separate from geometric proof. Only ENGINEERING has authoritative DXF geometry. For BASIC_DXF compare the uploaded source, artwork and real round-trip/material preview. Program entity checks own closure, topology, units and reimport; never pass failed geometry. CAD layer colors, document headers, scale notices and annotations are display aids, not product color or defects. MATERIAL_PREVIEW shows actual retained CUT material. Engraving is not a through-cut opening. Unknown size/strength remains unverified. BITMAP_VISUAL has no cutting rules; SCENE prioritizes locked product fidelity and plausible placement/light. Check exactly the relevant module quality_profile and explicit facts, including visible quantity, use, packaging, ghosting and occlusion when required; do not invent missing requirements. Recommend AI_EDIT only for an observable fix preserving unaffected features. LOCAL can execute scale/position corrections. REGENERATE is for a genuinely wrong whole subject/purpose/composition; do not force repairs on a good image. Every visible local issue needs a normalized bbox in the current final image. When post_revision_targets is present, compare each same-target_id at its fixed bbox: CRITICAL_CROP panels show BEFORE left / AFTER right; STRUCTURE_DEFECT_OVERVIEW shows the full before/after canvases and remaining numbered regions. All targets and deterministic component facts are in structured_evidence/post_revision_targets. Return one revision_checks row per target with concrete before_observation and after_observation against success_criterion. Recheck eyes, nose/mouth, head/neck, chest, legs, tail and overall silhouette; scenes also holes/text/parts/direction/texture/material. Report new regressions as issues even if the requested target improved. New files or changed pixels are not proof: persistent weak/thin/detached parts must be PERSISTENT; unseen or incomparable evidence must be UNCERTAIN/NOT_COMPARABLE, never RESOLVED. Preserve unaffected areas. AI judgments are not human approval or physical testing. No hidden reasoning. Use concise Simplified Chinese for employee-facing observations, recommendations and summary (<=600 characters). Context: "
